Package: libgdm1
Version: @DEB_LIBGDM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdm
Depends: libglib2.0-0
Description: GNOME Display Manager (client library)
 The libgdm client library for rootless iOS. gnome-shell imports gi://Gdm at
 boot (dependencies, system actions, the unlock and login dialogs), so this
 library and its on-device generated Gdm-1.0 typelib are required for the shell
 to start. The gdm daemon itself is Linux-only and is not built; without it
 Gdm.Client cannot connect and the shell's greeter/lock integrations degrade
 gracefully. Session enumeration uses a single-session sd-login shim.
